  </div>
  <div class="pillars" data-reveal-group="up" data-reveal-stagger="140">
    <article class="pillar">
      <span class="pi"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="31.96,16.38 35.76,17.25 35.76,22.75 31.96,23.62 31.02,25.90 33.09,29.20 29.20,33.09 25.90,31.02 23.62,31.96 22.75,35.76 17.25,35.76 16.38,31.96 14.10,31.02 10.80,33.09 6.91,29.20 8.98,25.90 8.04,23.62 4.24,22.75 4.24,17.25 8.04,16.38 8.98,14.10 6.91,10.80 10.80,6.91 14.10,8.98 16.38,8.04 17.25,4.24 22.75,4.24 23.62,8.04 25.90,8.98 29.20,6.91 33.09,10.80 31.02,14.10" stroke="#1F2226" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><polygon points="25.20,23.00 20.00,26.00 14.80,23.00 14.80,17.00 20.00,14.00 25.20,17.00" stroke="#1F2226" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="2.4" fill="#DF681E"/></svg></span><h3>Mechanistic at the core</h3>
      <p>Trellis combines scientific reasoning with machine learning. AI orchestrates a set of agents that build your models, and those models account for bioprocess mechanics that most dry-lab tools leave out.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="pillar">
      <span class="pi"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 5 L34 13 L34 28 L20 36 L6 28 L6 13 Z M6 13 L20 21 L34 13 M20 21 L20 36" stroke="#1F2226" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><g fill="#1F2226"><circle cx="13" cy="17" r="1.1"/><circle cx="27" cy="17" r="1.1"/><circle cx="13" cy="25" r="1.1"/><circle cx="27" cy="25" r="1.1"/><circle cx="20" cy="12.5" r="1.1"/></g><circle cx="27" cy="25" r="2.3" fill="#DF681E"/></svg></span><h3>The full design space, all at once</h3>
      <p>Trellis handles design spaces with up to 50 parameters and explores the entire space, with every parameter in play at the same time, until it gets you to the true global optima.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="pillar">
      <span class="pi"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="18" r="12" stroke="#1F2226" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="24" cy="18" r="7" stroke="#1F2226" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="24" cy="18" r="2.6" fill="#DF681E"/><path d="M5 35 Q11 30 15 26" stroke="#1F2226" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/><circle cx="5" cy="35" r="1.6" fill="#1F2226"/></svg></span><h3>The fewest runs to get there</h3>
